sequenceDiagram
  participant UI as PublicShopPage
  participant API as shopApi
  participant R as shopRouter
  participant C as shopController
  participant S as Shop Model
  participant P as Product Model
  participant U as User Model
  participant DB as MySQL
  UI->>API: getByUser(userId)
  API->>R: GET /api/shops/user/:userId
  R->>C: getShopByUser(req,res)
  C->>S: findOne(ownerId)
  C->>P: findAll(sellerId, status=在售)
  C->>U: 读取信用快照
  S->>DB: SELECT shop/products/user
  C-->>UI: shop + credit + products
